#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Builds foundations of quantum computing, technology, and business applications."
msgstr "Membangun fondasi komputasi kuantum, teknologi, dan aplikasi bisnis."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Designed by IBM Quantum&reg; experts, this course covers the essentials of quantum computing and applications for business. Learn about this new computing paradigm, how it works, and its potential to address incredibly complex business problems. Complete the course to earn your IBM Quantum Business Foundations badge.\n"
msgstr "Dirancang oleh para ahli IBM Quantum&reg;, kursus ini mencakup esensi komputasi kuantum dan aplikasinya untuk bisnis. Pelajari paradigma komputasi baru ini, cara kerjanya, dan potensinya untuk mengatasi masalah bisnis yang sangat kompleks. Selesaikan kursus untuk mendapatkan lencana IBM Quantum Business Foundations milikmu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Ujian {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for Quantum business foundations, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training linked below. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. Once you have passed the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan lencana Quantum business foundations-mu, ikuti ujian di IBM&reg; Training yang ditautkan di bawah ini. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diikuti setelah membaca pelajaran-pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah kamu lulus ujian, kamu akan diberitahu oleh Credly bahwa kamu telah mendapatkan lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Ujian](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations/exam)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Awarded Badge {#awarded-badge}"
msgstr "Lencana yang Diberikan {#awarded-badge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![\"Image of the awarded badge\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-business-foundations/badge.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Credly {#credly}"
msgstr "Credly {#credly}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/). IBM employees can view the IBM Internal Privacy Statement [here](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice).\n"
msgstr "PEMBERITAHUAN: IBM memanfaatkan layanan Credly, pemroses data pihak ketiga yang diotorisasi oleh IBM dan berlokasi di Amerika Serikat, untuk membantu dalam administrasi program IBM Digital Badge. Untuk menerbitkan IBM Digital Badge untukmu, informasi pribadimu (nama, alamat email, dan lencana yang diperoleh) akan dibagikan ke Credly. Kamu akan menerima notifikasi email dari Credly dengan instruksi untuk mengklaim lencana. Informasi pribadimu digunakan untuk menerbitkan lencana dan untuk pelaporan program serta tujuan operasional. IBM dapat membagikan informasi pribadi yang dikumpulkan dengan anak perusahaan IBM dan pihak ketiga secara global. Informasi tersebut akan ditangani sesuai dengan praktik privasi IBM. Pernyataan Privasi IBM dapat dilihat [di sini.](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/) Karyawan IBM dapat melihat Pernyataan Privasi Internal IBM [di sini.](https://w3.ibm.com/w3publisher/w3-privacy-notice)\n"
